+# Plan
+
+## 1. Tests
+
+- [ ] 1.1 A Card with a customTitle shows it in place of its default title (tests/card.test.js) [AC-1] [AC-2] [AC-3]
+
+## 2. Fix
+
+- [ ] 2.1 Card takes customTitle and defaultTitle, and encodes the one it shows (src/common/Card.js)
+- [ ] 2.2 The stats, top languages and WakaTime cards pass custom_title to Card (src/cards/)
+- [ ] 2.3 The endpoints read custom_title from the query and pass it to their card (api/)
+- [ ] 2.4 Document custom_title for each card (readme.md, docs/readme_es.md)
